    "player_playstyle": "military",
    "chance": 5000,
    "notes": "The heath of Hardsyssel is poor land and hard men. Our hall at Herning commands ten lords, and the riders of the heath respect only strength, faith and the old ways. The mink farmers grumble, Copenhagen sells our rights to Swedes, and the heath is waiting for a master.",
